t5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null}},"_id":"UvDXjbPMpmJB3cwH","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"iDjm2cXyRAe4VZ35","img":"icons/magic/water/vortex-water-whirlpool.webp","name":"Howling Blizzard","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Freezing winds extend from your hands, pushing away from you with great force. If you Cast this Spell with 2 actions, it has an area of a 60-foot cone; if you Cast this Spell with 3 actions, it has a range of 500 feet and an area of a 30-foot burst. Each creature in the area takes 10d6 cold damage with a basic Reflex save. Snowdrifts and icy gales fill the area until the start of your next turn, making the area difficult terrain.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"howling-blizzard","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["air","cold","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"cone","value":60},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"2YlEXgT93lbWXENb":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"10d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"cold"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"reflex"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"UvDXjbPMpmJB3cwH","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"area":0,"damage":{"2YlEXgT93lbWXENb":"2d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"overlays":{"ZxbNsu1w4bhR2fCe":{"_id":"ZxbNsu1w4bhR2fCe","overlayType":"override","sort":1,"system":{}},"wUTd1CuL1B5jIquK":{"_id":"wUTd1CuL1B5jIquK","overlayType":"override","sort":2,"system":{"area":{"type":"burst","value":30},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"time":{"value":"3"}}}}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spells.Item.xxWhyl81w3ckslAU","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"NhSDF0ANfRXy3rz1"},{"folder":"7cyoYPoPYA01mErU","img":"icons/environment/wilderness/cave-entrance-vulcano.webp","name":"Mirage","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create an illusion that causes natural terrain to look, sound, feel, and smell like a different kind of terrain. This doesn't disguise any structures or creatures in the area.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches the illusion or uses the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> Your image can also disguise structures or create illusory structures (but still doesn't disguise creatures).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mirage","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","illusion","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":50},"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"until your next daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"UvDXjbPMpmJB3cwH","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spells.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"HaVq6QZruONhCMDe"},{"folder":"iDjm2cXyRAe4VZ35","img":"icons/magic/water/barrier-ice-crystal-wall-jagged-blue.webp","name":"Wall of Ice","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You sculpt an ice barrier that blocks sight and, once shattered, freezes foes. You create either a 1-foot-thick wall of ice in a straight line up to 60 feet long and 10 feet high (the wall doesn't have to be vertical, but it must be anchored on both sides to a solid surface) or a 1-foot-thick, 10-foot radius hemisphere of ice. The ice that makes up the wall is opaque. If you wish, the wall can be of a smaller length, height, or radius.</p>\n<p>You must create the wall in an unbroken open space so its edges don't pass through any creatures or objects, or the spell is lost. Each 10-foot-by-10-foot section of the wall has AC 10, Hardness 10, and 40 Hit Points, and it's immune to critical hits, cold damage, and precision damage. A section also has weakness 15 to fire; a section of the wall destroyed by fire melts, evaporating into water and steam. A section destroyed by means other than fire leaves behind a chilling mass of ice that is difficult terrain and deals 2d6 cold damage to any creature passing through it.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The Hit Points of each section of the wall increase by 10, and the cold damage dealt to creatures crossing a destroyed section increases by 1d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"wall-of-ice","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cold","concentrate","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"3"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"cold"}},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"UvDXjbPMpmJB3cwH","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.R5FHRv7VqyRnxg2t","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"8810c5OQuMwfYi5h"},{"type":"spell","name":"Falling Icicles","folder":"uEFGbfMYBJKWBi3Y","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You conjure a cluster of sharpened icicles in the air before letting them fall. All creatures in the area take 1d6 piercing damage and 1d6 cold damage, with a basic Reflex save. Creatures that fail the saving throw are frozen 2.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 piercing and 1d6 cold.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cold","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":{"value":10,"type":"burst"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"9elpZtfJyLNTLC3s":{"formula":"1d6","kinds":["damage"],"type":"piercing","category":null,"materials":[],"applyMod":false},"kKngICg8mNDFJORD":{"formula":"1d6","kinds":["damage"],"type":"cold","category":null,"materials":[],"applyMod":false}},"defense":{"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"UvDXjbPMpmJB3cwH","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{"9elpZtfJyLNTLC3s":"1d6","kKngICg8mNDFJORD":"1d6"},"area":0}},"img":"icons/magic/water/projectile-ice-chunks-salvo.webp","effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.sf2e-spells.Item.JCQxDEB0CFIoveu6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"_id":"62bec1ivC56UTJoj"},{"folder":"7cyoYPoPYA01mErU","img":"icons/magic/symbols/ring-circle-smoke-blue.webp","name":"Translocate (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"translocate","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","teleportation"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"UvDXjbPMpmJB3cwH","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"5":{"range":{"value":"1 mile"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.VlNcjmYyu95vOUe8","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"bZKv2wsDurwNZvul"},{"type":"spell","name":"Winter's Grasp","folder":"MYtFH2KK4Kkb9Z7H","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You infuse the ground with the essence of winter, coating it in supernaturally cold ice. All creatures in the area of the spell when you first cast it take 4d6 cold damage (basic Reflex save). While the spell lasts, the icy ground is difficult terrain, and each creature standing on the ice must succeed at their choice of a Reflex save or an Acrobatics check against your spell DC or fall @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}. Creatures using an action to move onto the ice during the spell's duration must also attempt their choice of either a Reflex save or an Acrobatics check to @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.M76ycLAqHoAgbcej]{Balance}. A creature that ends its turn standing on the ice takes 8 cold damage with a basic Fortitude save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the cold damage that creatures take from the initial casting by 1d6 and the cold damage they take from ending their turn in the ice by 2.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cold","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"value":20,"type":"burst"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":true},"damage":{"JFFYdf7hdJpytbXU":{"formula":"4d6","kinds":["damage"],"type":"cold","category":null,"materials":[],"applyMod":false}},"defense":{"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"UvDXjbPMpmJB3cwH","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{"JFFYdf7hdJpytbXU":"1d6"},"area":0}},"img":"icons/magic/water/snowflake-ice-purple.webp","effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.sf2e-spells.Item.FTjpdbJKibOcgZPN","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"_id":"0nrT4jB9FkjxNuAI"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"icons/magic/movement/trail-streak-impact-blue.webp","name":"Frostbite","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An orb of biting cold coalesces around your target, freezing its body. The target takes 2d4 cold damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target also gains weakness 1 to bludgeoning until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spell-effects.Item.DdqWMj7cuf4S1bgr]{Spell Effect: Frostbite}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4 and the weakness on a critical failure increases by 1.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"frostbite","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","cold","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","ta